  "policies": [
    "Five actual roots, one fixed Golem, existing Coin; no complete global generation pool is needed.",
    "Forest counts physical friendly Minions including dormant but excluding interactables. Ursol uses current friendly/enemy relation and shared stat setting, with normal aura and damage-reset semantics.",
    "Triumph requires a character target only without an earlier actual played copy. A finite engine-owned history target predicate uses existing played-card facts, excludes its own active paid root, and leaves the shared IF_AVAILABLE/automatic target machinery in charge. Exact alternate-origin and history acceptance windows remain M6.",
    "Bribe ordinary destroy/opponent Coin and conditional own Coin use the existing frozen spell Combo condition; minion/weapon/hero Combo declarations are not spell declarations. Ordinary text runs once.",
    "Moss summons two fixed Golems before an actual all-available Mana debit. Reward joins original attributed summon deliveries to original successful entry records of the same actual cast; source payment outcome drives BuffSummonedMinion, never current-name matching. Extra original summon deliveries share the reward, failed or departed entries do not rebind.",
    "CATA_581 remains pending: the official renderer omits its raw dynamic placeholder and raw script integer alone does not prove the formula. No guessed implementation."
  ]
